# No auto-merge

Never merge a pull request yourself — even if asked to "open PR and merge" in one message.

1. Branch, commit, push, open PR — OK.
2. Stop. Give the PR URL and CI status.
3. Merge only after the user explicitly confirms **after** seeing CI (or explicitly accepts risk).

Forbidden without that confirmation: `gh pr merge`, GitHub MCP merge, squash/rebase into `main`.
